secp256k1 signature by the Bitcoin (2026) genesis key over the SHA-256 of
CHAIN_SOURCE_MANIFEST.json (schema 2).

  message signed   051de993426662608f2bfbcd4281cfbfb98571a4dc4993750e0506e191acc9d1
                   (the ASCII hex string above, 64 characters -- NOT the raw digest bytes)
  public key       04c0414cfdcc009830708543b06e43a03570dc1ffa45ddf98657045e594a815eba79
                   4ca0602e8527d7ba3197e53c0c2f226892212aa99b827e8e2fd95fcea2f834
  genesis          00000000ad12f3ecd9b14e4276ac98936fb0d658f05dce95ad35d18fceee208a

